518    -- The composition guard assertions (spec-patch-07 section 5.2), proven directly against the
519    -- real tables, bypassing road_admin_api entirely -- the point of an assertion over a package
520    -- check is that it holds when the package does not run. Every insert here targets a
521    -- (role, permission) pair not already in road_role_permissions, and every branch rolls back, so
522    -- these leave no state behind for teardown to clean up.
523    ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
